Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.70,0:00:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Music plays. I look up to the\Nstars and reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.34,0:00:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in tomorrow if we try!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.36,0:00:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.40,0:00:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.20,0:00:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the music!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.64,0:00:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We share the music!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.58,0:00:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, baby, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.12,0:00:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the one dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.38,0:00:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the good times!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We share the good times!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.52,0:00:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, baby, baby, oh\Nwe share the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to see for you and me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.78,0:00:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Through the darkness\Nthat is in this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So hard to see or to believe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.70,0:00:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In where we need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you and me, it's true that we\NFeel the rush brought up by this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Through head to feet, I feel the beat!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.80,0:00:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting me to walk on, oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the music, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.96,0:00:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one dream, believe in yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.02,0:00:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the time, take my hand now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.96,0:00:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.42,0:00:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.62,0:00:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.32,0:01:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.42,0:01:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try no matter how high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.78,0:01:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So let us go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.56,0:01:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond, far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.42,0:01:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.40,0:01:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try high!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.58,0:01:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.06,0:01:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.92,0:01:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.24,0:01:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, baby, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.96,0:01:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.56,0:01:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, as we chase, we're being chased.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,From the top we go, one straight and wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.86,0:01:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on our way. I've got to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.78,0:01:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I want to share your style.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.52,0:01:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now here it starts, so don't lose heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.76,0:01:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They're bound to lose to this flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,From boot to hood, I feel so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.72,0:01:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be free to be, oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.48,0:01:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the music, even if I Share\Nthe one dream, I know where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.58,0:01:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the good times,\Nshare the one world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.44,0:01:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.58,0:01:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.46,0:01:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.42,0:01:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try no matter how high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.78,0:01:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So let us go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.46,0:01:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond, far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.44,0:01:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.42,0:02:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.76,0:02:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that you are there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.58,0:02:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.68,0:02:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait there for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.56,0:02:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon it will be you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.80,0:02:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let us go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.58,0:02:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond, far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.38,0:02:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.60,0:02:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.92,0:02:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.10,0:02:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.96,0:02:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.84,0:02:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, baby, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.90,0:02:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.34,0:02:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We owe you our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.98,0:02:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't forget what\Nyou've done, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.42,0:02:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for giving us the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.62,0:03:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.68,0:03:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get annihilated out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.38,0:03:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be very bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.26,0:03:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you even say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.78,0:03:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.94,0:03:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye, Lola, and thanks for the\Nfever card! I'll miss you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.94,0:03:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope we meet again someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.80,0:03:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If you see my mama, tell\Nher I said hi, Nomizo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.38,0:03:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.02,0:03:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.38,0:03:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess they're gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.34,0:03:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.54,0:03:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the fog's come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.92,0:03:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We set sail tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.44,0:03:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.30,0:03:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No one knows the truth behind what\Nhappens in the Sea of Mysteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.30,0:03:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The Florian Triangle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.32,0:04:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Each year, over a hundred ships sail\Ninto the mists, never to return!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.58,0:04:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The giant ship Thriller Bark first dropped
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.76,0:04:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,anchor in these dark waters ten years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.18,0:04:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But the tales of terror and\Ndisappearances came long before then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.12,0:04:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it is fortunate that the thick\Nmist is abundant on this day as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.90,0:04:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,cloaking the terrors of these\Nmysterious waters like a white veil.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.52,0:04:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy huh you sure you're okay with this\Nhuh oh right you mean i use this paper
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.10,0:04:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be fine. Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.52,0:04:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy we can take a detour\Nif you like i wouldn't mind
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.34,0:04:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Time has proven to be no obstacle\Nto either me or Laboon so
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.02,0:05:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,long as i draw breath i know\Nwe'll be Reunited someday yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.28,0:05:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,it's fine you do what you want\Ncaptain we don't care one bit
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.62,0:05:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm ready to go everywhere.\NWow, I want to meet Luffy's bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.22,0:05:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,in the big whale bro seriously\Nit's okay even if Ace wasn't
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.98,0:05:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,some kind of trouble he wouldn't\Nwant his little brother to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.26,0:05:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,come bail him out that drive\NHim crazy he hates to show his
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.66,0:05:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,weak side and he never asked for\Nhelp if i saved his life he'd
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.74,0:05:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,probably just get mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.82,0:05:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,As pirates, we're supposed\Nto be rivals anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.48,0:05:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,His adventures are his
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.48,0:05:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,business, even if they turn out bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.10,0:05:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, keep your hopes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.68,0:05:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Lola's pals were saying the card doesn't\Njust shrink when someone's in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.08,0:05:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It also grows bigger if\Nthings get better for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.00,0:05:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.91,0:05:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll see him again when\Nhe's back to full strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.72,0:05:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that's what he was
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.66,0:05:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,thinking when he gave me that card, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.60,0:05:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.92,0:05:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You were asleep for the big party,\Nso I guess you missed out on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.88,0:05:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, no harm in doing\Nit one more time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.54,0:06:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's all raise our mouths in celebration\Nof our newest crew member, the musician,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.34,0:06:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Brooke!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.90,0:06:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.76,0:06:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, you're too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.30,0:06:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Full speed ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.56,0:06:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get moving with\Nthe Coup de Burst! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.62,0:06:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Coup de Burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.98,0:06:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We're flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.04,0:06:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.30,0:06:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.44,0:06:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Bartholomew Kuma has returned, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.12,0:06:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.94,0:06:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it that even with your power,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.18,0:06:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,you couldn't stop the\NStraw Hatch from escaping?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.10,0:06:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who has to\Nexplain this to the top brass,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.64,0:06:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,so your story better be damn good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.76,0:06:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my grandson for ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.74,0:07:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear it, Garp.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.54,0:07:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You were ordered to exterminate\Nevery pirate on Thriller Bark,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.96,0:07:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,but you failed to even breathe\Nback Straw Hat Luffy's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.72,0:07:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a disgrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.54,0:07:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it, Sengoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.16,0:07:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, Luffy brought down Moria, but he\Nain't gonna go around blabbing about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.16,0:07:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would believe him anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.82,0:07:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you didn't take pity on those pirates\Njust because they were injured, Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.26,0:07:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Compassion is wasted on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.98,0:07:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't make them change\Ntheir course one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.18,0:07:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And speaking of course, if they\Nkeep following their long pose,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.50,0:07:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,they'll be on the doorstep of\NNavy headquarters in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.66,0:07:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, I got this fancy pants\Ntea I've been wanting to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.98,0:07:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Break out some crackers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.94,0:07:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't wait a sec, Garp!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.48,0:07:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.82,0:08:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a sea snake current!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.06,0:08:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, but what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.28,0:08:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Brace yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.60,0:08:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We can do this, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.00,0:08:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Comes, you better steer the ship right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.24,0:08:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we made it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.50,0:08:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I wasn't scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.96,0:09:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We're finally here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.98,0:09:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.08,0:09:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even see the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.64,0:09:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.58,0:09:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is the red line!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.54,0:09:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.14,0:09:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels sort of nostalgic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.90,0:09:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting a bit choked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.58,0:09:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It hasn't been that long since we last\Nsaw this, but I feel like we've grown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.18,0:09:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't seem to stop crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.26,0:09:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess a lot's happened, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.52,0:09:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we're halfway there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.68,0:09:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The twin capes where we\Nmet Laboon are connected
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.22,0:09:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,to the red line on the\Nother side of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.80,0:09:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We've had some close calls, but I'm glad\Nwe made it this far without losing anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.52,0:09:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was a baby, I came to the\NSouth Blue Down Reverse Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.98,0:09:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But that was well over 30 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.36,0:09:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The red line means a lot\Nmore to me this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.10,0:09:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I came from the west blue to\Nthis ocean five years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.92,0:09:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,but it seems like forever now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.16,0:09:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If we keep this up and sail\Naround the rest of the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.00,0:10:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll come to this wall one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.02,0:10:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And when we do, then I'm\Ngonna be king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.74,0:10:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to be extra\Ncareful from here on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.40,0:10:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We're right next to the\Nholy land of Marijua.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.30,0:10:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,home of Navy headquarters\Nand the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.62,0:10:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,How did we ever live\Nwithout a swimming pool?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.40,0:10:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.10,0:10:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be powerless again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.04,0:10:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let myself be weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.24,0:10:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't fail my crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.60,0:11:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Robin, Brooke,\NLuffy, do you see anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.42,0:11:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No use.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.62,0:11:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pitch black.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.32,0:11:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, pitch black!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.02,0:11:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, no, I think I just saw something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.34,0:11:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.52,0:11:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Its eyes were glowing in the dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.22,0:11:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he say monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.92,0:11:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.02,0:11:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I suppose I'm already dead, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.58,0:11:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that reminds me, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.50,0:11:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a dying request.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.98,0:11:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you be so kind as to tell me\Nwhat kind of panties you're wearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.94,0:11:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You want a monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.04,0:11:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you one!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.94,0:11:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,For a skeleton, he sure has guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.40,0:11:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Shark Suburge 3 has a max\Ndepth of 5,000 meters,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.66,0:11:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So be careful you don't get\Nyourself in trouble down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.22,0:12:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.24,0:12:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't imagine it's supposed to\Nmake that horrid creaking noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.84,0:12:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. That's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.38,0:12:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid we already passed 5,000 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.26,0:12:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.36,0:12:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.27,0:12:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.19,0:12:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The water pressure's going to\Ncrush the submarine like a tin can.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.88,0:12:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's that monster again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.06,0:12:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he likes us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.20,0:12:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My, what big teeth he has.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.58,0:12:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That was brutal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.22,0:12:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He thinks we're food.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.06,0:12:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it comes again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.86,0:12:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So are they in trouble or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.58,0:12:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I ever want to ride\Nin Shark Submerge 3. No kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.44,0:12:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami Swan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.02,0:12:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a nice tart with horror\Npears I found on Thriller Bark.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.34,0:12:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds scary, but I promise it's yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.36,0:12:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I can't wait to try it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.40,0:12:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.31,0:13:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's behind us! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.30,0:13:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna eat us! Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.20,0:13:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This really is a mess, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.80,0:13:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.02,0:13:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.36,0:13:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we knew where we were\Ngoing, but it's like Skypiea all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.44,0:13:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.68,0:13:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we know which direction to go,\Nthat doesn't tell us how to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.66,0:13:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break, Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.80,0:13:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.48,0:13:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.26,0:13:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.17,0:13:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that ever fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.70,0:13:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice job staying alive, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.84,0:13:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,For all the good it did me, I\Ncouldn't see a thing down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.18,0:13:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure this is\Nwhere Fishman Island's at?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.44,0:13:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No loss for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.66,0:13:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd gladly do that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.42,0:13:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd have gone farther down, but the\Nwater pressure would have crushed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.66,0:13:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what else to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.14,0:13:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The Log Pose is definitely\Npointing straight down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.66,0:13:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.08,0:14:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late now, but I should\Nhave asked Lola how this works.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.40,0:14:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.31,0:14:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.34,0:14:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.66,0:14:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think you can beat me out of\Nthe water, you're in for a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.48,0:14:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Gumbum!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.78,0:14:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Rifle!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.80,0:14:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.96,0:14:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't seem all that big.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.88,0:14:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We did just fight oars.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.82,0:14:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everything's gonna seem small.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.20,0:14:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, something flew out of its mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.24,0:14:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A fish. A girl
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.92,0:15:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.64,0:15:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,is that I think so Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.74,0:15:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell yes! Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.50,0:15:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.90,0:15:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.04,0:15:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.96,0:15:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I crushed a human. Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.88,0:15:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.48,0:15:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you OK? OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.36,0:15:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I'm OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.48,0:15:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Never been better anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.64,0:15:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.12,0:15:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull yourself together!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.88,0:15:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a tail!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.30,0:15:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he must have hit his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.58,0:15:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He's acting weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.18,0:15:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,With fins?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.18,0:15:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should lie down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.60,0:15:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that means she's a...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.36,0:15:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A mermaid!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.78,0:16:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.08,0:16:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh, there's a bunch of humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.80,0:16:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.71,0:16:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's all stop screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.68,0:16:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I was just startled.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.70,0:16:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, thanks for saving my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.34,0:16:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like I'm always\Ngetting swallowed by sea kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.72,0:16:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This was probably the 20th time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.66,0:16:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta stop that. Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.90,0:16:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,There has to be some way\Nto pay you guys back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.86,0:16:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, octopus fritters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.10,0:16:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You have some?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.06,0:16:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, give me. Give me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.32,0:16:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.23,0:16:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,They're 500 berries each.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.26,0:16:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How many can I put you down for?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.80,0:16:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not selling them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.28,0:16:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.18,0:16:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally met a real mermaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.84,0:16:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mermaids!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.75,0:16:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Loved by sailors the whole world wide!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.98,0:16:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Mermaids, the jewels of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.82,0:16:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And she's adorable, just like I imagined!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.56,0:16:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm kidding, you're even\Nbetter than I imagined!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.48,0:16:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You said your name was Kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.84,0:16:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the best day of my whole life!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.62,0:16:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.16,0:16:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.07,0:16:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You met Granny Kokoro, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.14,0:16:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Gigantic monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.10,0:16:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Zombies. That was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.94,0:17:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.10,0:17:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart already felt the true\Nmeaning of terror when I saw her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.90,0:17:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.06,0:17:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I know just how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.52,0:17:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just forget that\Never happened, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.36,0:17:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the first mermaid we've met.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.02,0:17:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you be any more rude? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.40,0:17:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that Granny\NKokoro was a mermaid?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.14,0:17:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But she could walk and stuff. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.00,0:17:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess you never found out, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.82,0:17:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You were busy fighting that luchi\Nguy when she saved us from drowning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.54,0:17:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.18,0:17:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you die on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.20,0:17:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Granny Kokoro was cool and all, but thinking\Nof her as a mermaid is really gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.68,0:17:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be old someday, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.88,0:17:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.86,0:17:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.66,0:17:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, I've had enough of you men\Nand your gross mermaid fantasies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.48,0:17:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, she is rather cute, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.14,0:17:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my first encounter\Nwith a mermaid as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.04,0:17:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, but would you be so\Nkind as to lend me some money?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.22,0:17:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell, Brooke?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.12,0:18:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Skeletons!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.03,0:18:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're scaring her, you big freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.00,0:18:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.98,0:18:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I can open my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.62,0:18:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty cool, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.56,0:18:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That is cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.26,0:18:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And now she's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.50,0:18:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So I gotta know, how do you poop?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.84,0:18:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.20,0:18:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, poop, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.78,0:18:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She doesn't poop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.86,0:18:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one pooping here! Hey, Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.52,0:18:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.72,0:18:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you forgetting someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.30,0:18:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a friend that you might have neglected\Nto include in your fun little chat?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.04,0:18:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.60,0:18:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So, uh, one question,\NKuma, what is this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.88,0:18:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, uh, talking glove, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.14,0:18:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, no, this guy is my pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.22,0:18:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is Papa Goo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.50,0:18:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a starfish and also my teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.60,0:18:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.52,0:18:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.76,0:18:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it normal for starfish to talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.98,0:18:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,As normal as it is for your\Npet to be your teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.94,0:18:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I let her take me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.66,0:18:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We have our reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.92,0:19:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.96,0:19:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,She feeds me clams.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.96,0:19:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.87,0:19:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I am what I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.32,0:19:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your pet food?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.36,0:19:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A starfish is a star.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.88,0:19:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And when people don't know\Nwho you are, it's so rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.40,0:19:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Will I stick around?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.46,0:19:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm no sucker, but my\Nsuckers are sicky enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.86,0:19:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Does anybody need a hand? Don't sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.26,0:19:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got plenty, but as for fingers, baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.06,0:19:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Cakes I don't got any no
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.80,0:19:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,fingers yeah thanks everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.60,0:19:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on this is the part You guys\Nare supposed to laugh my t-shirt
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.58,0:19:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,is made by criminal they're a\Nreally popular Fashion label on fish
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.68,0:19:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Man island that's pretty cool and\NPapa Goo is their lead designer. I
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.28,0:19:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,want To be one too someday so that's\Nwhy he's teaching me you can do it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.82,0:20:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,whatever it is you can do it Oh thanks\Nthat's so sweet of you you can be
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.00,0:20:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,a model too you should put on a\Nfashion show for us Oh no I don't think
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.78,0:20:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,so glove guy how can you talk I'm\Nso glad you asked he got over that
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.66,0:20:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,one quick See back when I was a kid\NI was a little confused I thought I
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.38,0:20:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,was a human but by the Time I figured\Nout I was a starfish I already
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.02,0:20:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,knew how to talk well I didn't know\Ntalking worked Like that the brain
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.12,0:20:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,is a powerful thing my friend they\Nsay you can do anything you put your
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.26,0:20:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,mind to Anyway whatever I'm papa goo\Nthe starfish up and coming fashion
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.82,0:20:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,designer thanks for saving me\NSeriously you guys are the best we're
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.52,0:20:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,lucky we met you the truth is we're\Na bit lost since you're From around
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.42,0:20:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,here no nami octopus fighters first\Nright I forgot I won't charge you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.70,0:20:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,either hold on Let me call Hatchan\Nand we'll work out a meeting spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.02,0:20:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is Hatchan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.50,0:20:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.98,0:20:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you doing okay, Hatchan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.50,0:20:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry I got kind of lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.96,0:20:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So where are you right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.92,0:21:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so it's Kuma, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.56,0:21:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hatchan?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.47,0:21:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know who you're talking to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.14,0:21:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This ain't your buddy, Hatchan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.08,0:21:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not Hatchan!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.76,0:21:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.67,0:21:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, this is Macro from\Nthe Big Dumb Macro Gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.08,0:21:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I shouldn't say that myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.38,0:21:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My goodness, this sounds like trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.34,0:21:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing with\NHotchen's transponder, snail?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.86,0:21:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We beat him up and stole it from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.70,0:21:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.12,0:21:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.03,0:21:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lie to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.95,0:21:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way Hatchan would lose to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.72,0:21:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Normally, you'd be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.98,0:21:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We aren't really a match for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.94,0:21:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But this time, we teamed up\Nwith the Flying Fish Riders,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.46,0:21:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and he didn't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.08,0:21:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The Flying Fish Riders, damn it! You!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.50,0:21:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma, you're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.14,0:21:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.48,0:21:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hatchan, don't tell me\Nthey really beat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.18,0:21:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You, I got my guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.16,0:21:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, no matter what they\Ntell you, don't come to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.04,0:21:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll beat these guys somehow\Nand get out on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.54,0:22:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll meet up with you\Nlater, so don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.94,0:22:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hatchan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.56,0:22:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Kuma, we were planning\Non selling your friend here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.40,0:22:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Octopus Fishman bet you a high price, so\Nif you want to save him, You better hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.92,0:22:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, for the record, we're\Nat the Sabo Odi Archipelago,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.42,0:22:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,five kilometers east of Grove 44.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.62,0:22:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And did I fail to mention this is\Nthe Flying Fish Riders' hideout?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.92,0:22:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.88,0:22:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, Kuma, don't come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.24,0:22:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, sucker face, no one cares!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.06,0:22:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, see you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.22,0:22:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Hatchan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.92,0:22:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So, the fritters?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.98,0:22:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't the time for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.60,0:22:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.51,0:22:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Her friend on the transponder's\Nsnail sounds awfully familiar to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.60,0:22:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and they said he was an octopus fish man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.36,0:22:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, it's my imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.38,0:22:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.88,0:22:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Luffy-chin, but can I give you\Nyour octopus fritters some other time?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.60,0:22:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just that I have to save\Nmy friend before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.66,0:22:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.58,0:22:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! So, Kuma,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.88,0:22:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this might come\Nacross as meddlesome,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.00,0:23:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but if you're going to rescue your\Nfriend, you don't have to do it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.86,0:23:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You can leave that to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.12,0:23:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I said that wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.54,0:23:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What I meant is that you\Ncan leave it to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.32,0:23:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not our boss in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.64,0:23:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You can show us the way to\Nfish man island Which is a
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.88,0:23:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,good deal since you're probably\Nheaded back there anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.32,0:23:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure really?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.08,0:23:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. Right, Luffy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.32,0:23:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure you'll beat up all the bad\Nguys for me Luffy chin really
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.34,0:23:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and you'll save hot chin I guess\Nbut who is this hot chin guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.06,0:23:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He runs the octopus\Nfritter shop where I work
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.38,0:23:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He makes the best snacks\Nin the world promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.94,0:23:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna save those octopus fritters\Neven if it kills us you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.92,0:23:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Octopus snacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.78,0:23:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Octopus snacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.26,0:23:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, now that they're motivated,\Ncan you show me the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.18,0:23:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.38,0:23:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Grove 44 is a tiny island right here\Non the east edge of the archipelago.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.48,0:23:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Based at five kilometers east from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.82,0:23:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm guessing the Flying Fish\NRiders base is in this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.66,0:24:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,As for us, we're about here right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.16,0:24:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So if we head due west towards\NSabaody, we'll hit it on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.50,0:24:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,BAM simple as can be we\Ncan have some fish for
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.78,0:24:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,directions before we set\Noff right sounds good
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.96,0:24:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.87,0:24:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,All the fish are coming up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.30,0:24:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We need directions from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.14,0:24:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You! You! You!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.90,0:24:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They're scared of the flying fish riders,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.72,0:24:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,so they won't get too close,\Nbut they will show us the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.54,0:24:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.45,0:24:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you could talk to fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.26,0:24:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe the men are right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.46,0:24:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mermaids are really something.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.96,0:25:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, if you stick around, we can\Neat all the fish in the whole world.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.78,0:25:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You need a timeout? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.36,0:25:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.50,0:25:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, but one thing is bugging me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.82,0:25:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to follow fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.24,0:25:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.62,0:25:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.60,0:25:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And I guess fish are a lot smarter\Nthan I give them credit for.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.14,0:25:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.05,0:25:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.97,0:25:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They're drawing an arrow in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.50,0:25:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.41,0:25:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't have any\Nproblem following that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.64,0:25:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just wow. So cool. Oh, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.54,0:25:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Any mermaid could do the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.24,0:25:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so modest.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.42,0:25:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know any better.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.74,0:25:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm going to take the help.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.52,0:25:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Four o 'clock, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.52,0:25:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.16,0:25:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.42,0:25:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I noticed the sun is setting off.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.24,0:25:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Did we finally find a\Nway to Fishman Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.10,0:25:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.01,0:25:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.93,0:25:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a real-life mermaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.94,0:25:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Her name's Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.00,0:25:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't she cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.08,0:25:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.04,0:25:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a mermaid, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.32,0:26:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Never seen one before.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.74,0:26:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.28,0:26:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He erased his memory!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.36,0:26:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He has a friend that makes\Nreal good octopus fritters,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.52,0:26:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,so we're going to save\Nhim first so we can eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.60,0:26:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm kind of worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.04,0:26:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hatchan didn't sound like\Nhimself at all when they talked.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.54,0:26:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid they've done\Nsomething awful to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.86,0:26:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, he's tough enough to cope.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.64,0:26:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.80,0:26:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys, on the other hand, were\Nawful quick to offer your help,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.62,0:26:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,but are you positive you're\Nnot in over your head on this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.56,0:26:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.98,0:26:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.89,0:26:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, fair warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.81,0:26:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,These guys aren't the only\Nkidnappers in the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.82,0:26:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a whole bunch\Nof crews just like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.34,0:26:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sabaody Archipelago is\Na hotspot for kidnapping.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.48,0:26:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Human trafficking is big\Nbusiness around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.86,0:26:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean like slave trading or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.24,0:26:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty sick stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.66,0:26:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And seeing as mermaids fetch\Na high price on the market,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.56,0:26:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A trio of fishmen that\Ncall themselves the Macro
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.90,0:26:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Gang have been targeting\NKuma for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.76,0:26:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We were stuck in that sea\Nmonster's belly for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.82,0:26:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hachi probably got worried\Nabout us and figured
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.64,0:26:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,the Macro Gang kidnapped you or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.42,0:26:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he went after them to rescue\Nyou and got kidnapped himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.60,0:27:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that must be it
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.46,0:27:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hutchin's so kind, and he's\Nalways looking after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.16,0:27:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.46,0:27:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys named Hatchan, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.94,0:27:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Reminds me that dumbass\Noctopus from way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.70,0:27:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's that guy, there's\Nno way I'm helping him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.02,0:27:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But what are the odds, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.70,0:27:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Usually Hachi can take those guys,\Nor anybody else for that matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.90,0:27:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But with the flying fish riders\Ninvolved, it's a whole different story.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.42,0:27:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, but who are these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.46,0:27:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They're another one of those\Nkidnapping crews I mentioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.20,0:27:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They've really been\Nrunning the place lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.40,0:27:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Word is, once they target you,\Nyou're as good as done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.58,0:27:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Their boss Devil is this\Nscary guy with an iron mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.34,0:27:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody knows what his face looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.30,0:27:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, it seems like\Nthey're looking for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.60,0:27:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They've been stopping\Nevery ship that comes by
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.02,0:27:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,here and checking out their\Ncrews member by member.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.02,0:27:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, they sound like a real pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.28,0:27:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, how tough can they be?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.02,0:28:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine. Don't worry, Kuma,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.30,0:28:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll get the octopus fritters back\Nfor sure That's fritters salesman?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.74,0:28:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I, I'm sure you're right, luffy chin?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.90,0:28:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I'm right!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.02,0:28:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Brooke, why don't you play\Na song to lighten the mood?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.76,0:28:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,With pleasure, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.14,0:28:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What hey, guys! We're in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.08,0:28:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.30,0:28:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.21,0:28:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The fish said they're sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.40,0:28:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But they can't take us any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.60,0:28:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They're scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.82,0:28:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what? Someone's here? Ah! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.80,0:28:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Flying Fish Riders!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.98,0:28:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.89,0:28:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.38,0:28:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Kate! Katie!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.50,0:28:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.58,0:28:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.12,0:29:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They're in the sky, not the sea! Look up!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.16,0:29:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, they really can fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.08,0:29:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.44,0:29:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,They're our enemy, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.20,0:29:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, attacking his head on?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.12,0:29:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,They have seats and\Nhammawars and everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.28,0:29:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's them! Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.88,0:29:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are the Straw Hat Pirates\Ndown there, no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.22,0:29:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's contact the boss. You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.02,0:29:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we'd only make\Nit out with the mermaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.60,0:29:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our lucky day!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.98,0:29:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Master Duvall's gonna be\Nthrilled when he hears this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.48,0:29:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Here they come again!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.28,0:30:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They're dropping bombs. Jerks! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.78,0:30:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,72 caliber! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.02,0:30:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.66,0:30:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.64,0:30:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they're out of the water, flying fish\Ncan stay in the air up to five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.64,0:30:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's right, Master Devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.34,0:30:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt in my\Nmind that it's them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.50,0:30:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.16,0:30:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sir, I missed that last part.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.48,0:30:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.58,0:30:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He told us to go back to base.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.10,0:30:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.68,0:30:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss's orders. Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.28,0:30:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, but I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.20,0:30:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.84,0:30:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mackerel.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.92,0:30:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Master Devil?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.66,0:30:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That mermaid you were luring here\Nis on a pirate ship right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.54,0:30:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you aware of that? Huh? Kuma? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.06,0:31:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The very pirate ship I've been\Nsearching for all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.82,0:31:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,All my suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.00,0:31:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All my waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.36,0:31:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,will finally come to an\Nend i'll have my revenge
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.68,0:31:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,i'll kill that bastard that ruined my life
